<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover,interactive-widget=resizes-content"><meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff"><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='7' fill='%232563eb'/%3E%3Cpath d='M8 23V9h4v5.4L17.2 9h5.2l-5.8 6.1L23 23h-5.2l-3.7-5.4L12 19.4V23z' fill='white'/%3E%3C/svg%3E"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self' data: blob:; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-eval' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; worker-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'self'; frame-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'"><title>天工</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="lecture.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="tts.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="ai.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="model.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="star-home.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="shell.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="theme.css"><script src="theme-boot.js"></script></head>
<body>
<section id="landing" class="home" aria-label="天工首页" data-ready="0">
<canvas id="skyRipple" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
<div class="meteor-field" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
<header class="home-top">
 <div class="home-brand" id="homeBrand"><div><strong>天工</strong><span class="brandsub">随身学习工作台</span></div><span class="brandver">0.3.18</span></div>
 <button id="landingBack" class="home-return" type="button" hidden>‹ 返回刚才的工作</button>
</header>
<div id="starStage" aria-label="星穹首页">
 <canvas id="starCanvas"></canvas>
 <div id="starLabels"></div>
 <div class="star-hud">
  <span class="star-hint">拨转星空 · 点星打开 · 长按拖进黑洞收纳</span>
  <div class="star-hud-actions">
   <button id="starMotionBtn" type="button" aria-label="切换晃动">晃动</button>
   <button id="starListBtn" type="button" aria-label="列表视图">列表</button>
  </div>
 </div>
 <button id="starHoleBtn" class="star-hole-chip" type="button" aria-label="黑洞收纳"><span id="starHoleBadge" hidden>0</span></button>
</div>
<div class="home-scroll" id="homeScroll">
 <div class="home-hero">
  <p class="home-status"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span id="landingStatus">正在读取草稿</span><button id="homeSkyBtn" class="home-skybtn" type="button" hidden>✦ 回到星穹</button></p>
  <h1 id="homeTitle">今天，从哪件事开始？</h1>
  <p class="home-lead" id="homeLead">东西都留在本机，断网也能用。挑一件想做的，随时按返回键回来。</p>
  <button id="todayStrip" class="today-strip" type="button" hidden>
   <span class="today-when" id="todayWhen"></span>
   <span class="today-copy"><strong id="todayName"></strong><small id="todayMeta"></small></span>
   <span class="today-go" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
  </button>
 </div>
 <button id="resumeCard" class="home-resume" type="button" hidden disabled>
  <span class="home-resume-icon" id="resumeIcon" aria-hidden="true">↺</span>
  <span class="home-resume-copy"><span class="home-kicker">接着做</span><strong id="resumeTitle">继续写 Python</strong><small id="resumeDetail">草稿留在本机</small></span>
  <span class="home-resume-go" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
 </button>
 <section class="home-group" data-group="study" aria-label="学习">
  <div class="home-ghead"><h2>学习</h2><span>上课、背书、刷题，都在这一组</span></div>
  <div class="home-grid">
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="lecture" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎙</span><span class="home-tag">录音</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>上课</strong><small>录音、笔记、PPT 同一条时间轴</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="tts" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">EN</span><span class="home-tag">离线</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>英文朗读</strong><small>按句子朗读英文，可调语速</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="scan" data-kind="native" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">▣</span><span class="home-tag">相机</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>扫描文档</strong><small>拍书页和讲义，自动裁边，导出 PDF</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="focus" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">🍅</span><span class="home-tag">离线</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>专注番茄</strong><small>学一会儿歇一会儿，今天学了多久一目了然</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="cards" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">🗂</span><span class="home-tag">离线</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>记忆卡片</strong><small>快忘的自动排到前面，背过的越隔越久</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="mistakes" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">📕</span><span class="home-tag">离线</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>错题本</strong><small>错在哪、为什么错，记下来慢慢啃</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="habits" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">✅</span><span class="home-tag">离线</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>习惯打卡</strong><small>每天打个勾，看看自己坚持了几天</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="schedule" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">📅</span><span class="home-tag">离线</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>课程表</strong><small>下节课在哪上、还有几分钟，一眼看清</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="medquiz" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">🩺</span><span class="home-tag">离线</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>医学生刷题</strong><small>8 科基础题，答完看解析，错题自动收</small></span></button>
  </div>
 </section>
 <section class="home-group" data-group="create" aria-label="创作">
  <div class="home-ghead"><h2>创作</h2><span>写点代码、记点东西、修修图</span></div>
  <div class="home-grid">
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="python" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">&lt;/&gt;</span><span class="home-tag">离线</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>写代码</strong><small>Python、C++、网页，没网也能跑</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="notepad" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">✎</span><span class="home-tag">草稿</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>记事本</strong><small>想到什么写什么，关掉也不丢</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="photo" data-kind="native" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">◐</span><span class="home-tag">照片</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>修图</strong><small>调色、裁剪、拼图、加水印</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="model" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</span><span class="home-tag">离线</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>3D 建模</strong><small>在手机上捏模型，能导出 OBJ / GLB</small></span></button>
  </div>
 </section>
 <section class="home-group" data-group="more" aria-label="助手与休息">
  <div class="home-ghead"><h2>助手与休息</h2><span>问问题，或者玩一会儿</span></div>
  <div class="home-grid">
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="ai" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><span class="home-tag">联网</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>AI 助手</strong><small>有事问它；要动你手机里的东西，会先问你</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="game" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><span class="home-tag">游戏</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>星火远征</strong><small>之前的存档都还在，接着玩</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="pelican" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">🚲</span><span class="home-tag">3D</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>鹈鹕骑车</strong><small>点一下跳一下，别撞上就行</small></span></button>
   <button class="home-card" type="button" data-mode="novel" data-kind="web" disabled><span class="home-cardtop"><span class="home-icon" aria-hidden="true">📖</span><span class="home-tag">离线</span></span><span class="home-copy"><strong>小说阅读器</strong><small>导入 TXT 自动分章，进度记得住</small></span></button>
  </div>
 </section>
 <p class="home-foot">东西都会自动存好。想把改动写回手机上的原文件，打开文件点「保存」就行。</p>
</div>
<div id="starHoleSheet" class="star-hole-sheet" hidden>
 <div class="star-hole-head"><strong>黑洞收纳</strong><button id="starHoleClose" type="button" aria-label="关闭">✕</button></div>
 <div id="starHoleList"></div>
 <p class="star-hole-note">收进来的星星只是隐藏，随时放回或打开，不影响任何草稿。</p>
</div>
</section>
<header class="appbar"><button id="homeButton" class="homeback" type="button" aria-label="回到首页" title="回到首页"><span class="homeback-chev" aria-hidden="true">‹</span><span class="homeback-label">首页</span></button><button id="filesToggle" class="icon" aria-label="文件列表" title="文件列表">☰</button><div class="doc"><strong id="activePath">main.py</strong><small id="dirtyFlag">本地草稿</small></div><button id="drawToggle" class="icon drawtoggle" aria-label="画画" title="画画" aria-pressed="false" hidden>🖌️</button><button id="mdToggle" class="icon mdtoggle" aria-label="Markdown 预览" title="Markdown 预览" aria-pressed="false" hidden>👁</button><button id="saveButton" class="icon saveicon" aria-label="保存" title="保存">保存</button><button id="runButton" class="primary">▶ 运行</button><button id="stopButton" class="danger" hidden>■ 停止</button><button id="moreButton" class="icon" aria-label="更多操作" title="更多操作">⋯</button></header>
<section id="lectureBar" aria-label="上课录音控制" data-state="idle"><span class="recdot" aria-hidden="true"></span><button id="recordBtn" data-role="rec"><span id="recordLabel">🎙 开始录音</span></button><button id="pauseBtn" class="recalt" hidden>⏸ 暂停</button><button id="stopBtn" class="recstop" hidden>⏹ 停止</button><button id="newRecBtn" class="recalt" hidden>🎙 新录音</button><strong id="recordTimer">00:00</strong><label class="rec-translate" id="translateToggle"><input type="checkbox" id="translateCheck"><span class="reccheck"></span><span class="reclabel">翻译</span></label><span class="grow"></span><button id="anchorBtn" class="recanchor" hidden>📌<span class="anchorbtntext"> 标记锚点</span></button></section>
<section id="ttsBar" aria-label="英文朗读控制" data-state="idle">
<div class="tts-main"><span class="tts-mark" aria-hidden="true">EN</span><div class="tts-summary"><strong>英文朗读</strong><small id="ttsMeta" aria-live="off">在编辑器里输入或打开英文文本</small></div><button id="ttsPlay" class="tts-play" aria-label="开始英语朗读"><span id="ttsPlayText">朗读</span></button><button id="ttsStop" class="tts-stop" aria-label="停止英语朗读" title="停止">■</button></div>
<div class="tts-options"><label class="tts-field"><span>语音</span><select id="ttsVoice" aria-label="英语语音"><option value="">系统默认 · English</option></select></label><label class="tts-field tts-rate-field"><span>语速</span><input id="ttsRate" type="range" min="0.75" max="1.5" step="0.05" value="1" aria-label="英语朗读语速"><output id="ttsRateValue">1x</output></label><label class="tts-field tts-check"><input id="ttsHighlight" type="checkbox" checked aria-label="朗读时高亮当前句"><span>高亮</span></label><label class="tts-field tts-check"><input id="ttsAutoscroll" type="checkbox" aria-label="跟随朗读自动滚动"><span>滚动</span></label><span id="ttsStatus" role="status">正在准备英语语音…</span><div class="tts-progress" role="progressbar" aria-live="off" aria-label="朗读进度" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0"><span id="ttsProgressFill"></span></div></div>
</section>
<p id="lectureHint" class="lecturehint" role="status" hidden></p>
<section id="workbench">
<div id="backdrop" hidden></div><aside id="explorer" aria-label="工作区文件"><div class="sheethead"><strong>文件</strong><button id="closeExplorer" class="icon" aria-label="关闭文件列表">✕</button></div><div class="fileactions"><button id="openFile">打开文件</button><button id="openFolder">导入文件夹</button></div><div id="fileList"></div><div class="explorerfoot">编辑自动保存草稿<br>“保存”写回手机原文件</div><div class="sheetfoot"><button id="newFile" class="newfile">＋ 新建文件</button></div></aside>
<main class="workspace"><div id="editor" aria-label="代码编辑器"><div id="noteEmpty" aria-hidden="true">从这里开始写点什么…</div></div>
<div id="mdPreview" class="md-preview" hidden aria-label="Markdown 预览"></div>
<div id="drawLayer" hidden>
  <canvas id="drawCanvas" aria-label="画画画布"></canvas>
  <p id="drawHint">画画模式 · 手指涂写，双指捏合或滚轮缩放</p>
  <div id="drawToolbar">
    <button class="draw-tool active" data-tool="pen" title="画笔">✏️</button>
    <button class="draw-tool" data-tool="eraser" title="橡皮">🧹</button>
    <button class="draw-tool" data-tool="hand" title="手型 · 拖动平移">✋</button>
    <span class="draw-sep"></span>
    <button class="draw-action draw-zoom-btn" id="drawZoomOut" title="缩小">−</button>
    <span class="draw-zoom" id="drawZoomLabel" aria-live="off">100%</span>
    <button class="draw-action draw-zoom-btn" id="drawZoomIn" title="放大">＋</button>
    <button class="draw-action" id="drawZoomReset" title="恢复 100%">复位</button>
    <span class="draw-sep"></span>
    <button class="draw-color active" data-color="#3c3a32" style="background:#3c3a32" title="深色"></button>
    <button class="draw-color" data-color="#b45309" style="background:#b45309" title="棕色"></button>
    <button class="draw-color" data-color="#2563eb" style="background:#2563eb" title="蓝色"></button>
    <button class="draw-color" data-color="#dc2626" style="background:#dc2626" title="红色"></button>
    <button class="draw-color" data-color="#16a34a" style="background:#16a34a" title="绿色"></button>
    <span class="draw-sep"></span>
    <button class="draw-action" id="drawClear" title="清空画布">🗑️</button>
    <button class="draw-action" id="drawUndo" title="撤销">↶</button>
    <span class="grow"></span>
    <button class="draw-action" id="drawBack" title="返回文字">✎ 文字</button>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="console folded" id="consolePanel"><button class="consolehead" id="foldConsole" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="consoleBody" title="展开或收起终端"><span class="ctitle">终端</span><span id="runState">就绪</span><span class="chev">⌃</span></button><div class="consolebody" id="consoleBody"><div class="consolebar"><button id="outputTab" class="active">输出</button><button id="inputTab">输入</button><span class="grow"></span><button id="saveOutput">存输出</button><button id="clearOutput">清空</button></div><pre id="output" role="log" aria-live="polite"><span class="dim">写好代码点「运行」。Python、C++、JavaScript 都在本机跑，不联网。
程序要读输入时，先在「输入」页填好，一行一条。</span></pre><textarea id="stdin" hidden aria-label="标准输入" placeholder="运行前填写，每个 input() 一行。未提供的输入返回 EOF。" spellcheck="false"></textarea></div></section>
</main>
<aside id="lectureTimeline" aria-label="时间轴与锚点"><canvas id="timelineCanvas" aria-label="录音波形时间轴"></canvas><div class="tl-controls"><button id="zoomOut" aria-label="缩小时间轴" title="缩小">－</button><button id="zoomIn" aria-label="放大时间轴" title="放大">＋</button><button id="playRate" class="tl-rate" aria-label="播放倍速" title="播放倍速">1×</button><button id="linePlay" class="tl-line" aria-label="从本行播放 10 秒" title="从本行播放 10 秒">10s</button><span id="tlRange">全程</span></div><div id="anchorList" aria-label="锚点列表"></div></aside>
<aside id="lectureSlides" aria-label="PPT 照片"><div id="slideStage" hidden><img id="slideNow" alt="当前 PPT 页"><span id="slideNowLabel">第 1 页</span></div><div id="slideNav"><button id="slidePrev" aria-label="上一页" title="上一页">◀</button><span id="slidePos">0 / 0</span><button id="slideNext" aria-label="下一页" title="下一页（录音中翻页自动打点）">▶</button><button id="slideMark" title="给当前页打一个时间点">📌 打点</button></div><div id="slideList" aria-label="PPT 照片列表"></div><button id="importSlide">＋ 导入 PPT 照片</button><button id="importPptx">📄 导入 PPT 文件</button>
<div class="demoire-row"><label><input type="checkbox" id="demoireEnabled" checked> 拍后去摩尔纹</label><div class="demoire-slider"><input type="range" id="demoireStrength" min="0" max="100" value="60" aria-label="去摩尔纹强度"><output id="demoireValue">60%</output></div><p>拍屏幕/投影时手机稍微倾斜 2–5°，波纹会更少。主要处理彩色条纹；照片预览中可处理已有页面并对比原图，效果因图片而异。</p></div></aside>
</section>
<div id="lectureTabs" role="tablist" aria-label="上课面板切换"><button class="lecture-tab active" data-tab="notes" role="tab" aria-selected="true">笔记</button><button class="lecture-tab" data-tab="timeline" role="tab" aria-selected="false">时间轴</button><button class="lecture-tab" data-tab="slides" role="tab" aria-selected="false">PPT</button></div>
<div class="quickkeys" aria-label="编程快捷输入"><button data-key="tab">Tab</button><button data-key="undo" aria-label="撤销">↶</button><button data-key="redo" aria-label="重做">↷</button><button data-insert="(" data-pair=")">( )</button><button data-insert="[" data-pair="]">[ ]</button><button data-insert="{" data-pair="}">{ }</button><button data-insert=":">:</button><button data-insert="=">=</button><button data-insert="'">'</button><button data-insert="&quot;">"</button><button data-insert=",">,</button><button data-insert=".">.</button><button data-insert="#">#</button><button data-insert="    " aria-label="四空格缩进">␣␣</button><button data-key="left" aria-label="左移">←</button><button data-key="right" aria-label="右移">→</button><button data-key="newline" aria-label="换行">↵</button></div>
<footer class="statusbar"><span id="saveState">草稿已保存</span><span id="position">第 1 行，第 1 列</span><span id="noteCount"></span><span class="grow"></span><span id="language">Python</span><span id="encoding">UTF-8</span></footer>
<section id="lounge" hidden><div class="loungehead"><button id="codeTab">← 返回编辑器</button></div><article class="gamecard"><div class="gameart"><img src="../studio-game.png" alt="星火远征像素游戏场景"><span class="gamebadge">离线单机 · 进度保留</span></div><div class="gameinfo"><small>伍子平 · 星火远征</small><h2>从中山大学出发</h2><p>走进体内八境，或去数学星庭走一回机关。原来的游戏存档还在。</p><button id="playGame" class="primary playcta">进入游戏</button><p class="savehint" id="gameSaveInfo">进度自动保存。游戏里按返回键可回到这里。</p></div></article><div class="backuprow"><button id="exportGame">备份存档</button><button id="importGame">导入存档</button></div></section>

<section id="modelPanel" hidden aria-label="3D 建模">
 <div class="model-stage">
  <canvas id="modelCanvas" aria-label="3D 画布"></canvas>
  <div class="model-empty" id="modelEmpty"><strong>从一个形体开始</strong><span>点下方「添加」放一个立方体或球体，<br>单指转视角，双指缩放。</span></div>
  <p class="model-hint" id="modelHint">单指转视角 · 双指缩放/平移 · 点物体选中</p>
  <div class="model-top">
   <span class="model-selchip" id="modelSelChip">点一个物体选中，空白处拖动转视角</span>
   <button class="model-chipbtn" id="modelUndoBtn" type="button" aria-label="撤销" title="撤销" disabled>↶</button>
